# Plans stay outside the Flynn repo

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

Working notes, design docs, and implementation plans belong in the **workspace**
parent, not under `docs/`:

```
/Users/rgirard/Documents/FlynnWorkspace/.plans/<topic>.md
```

Do not add files to `docs/plans/` (that directory was removed). Keep
user-facing guides in `docs/content/`. When a plan is done, leave it in
`.plans/` unless the user asks to turn it into a guide.
